WEBVTT

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:38.240
Th-That's the power of this Gundam?

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:52.670
But hey, we're alive! Right, Tiffa?

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:57.260
Tiffa?

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.730
Too many people have died.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:13.940
Tiffa, you're going to-

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.740
What's wrong, Tiffa?! Tiffa!

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.080
Tiffa!

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:52.900
<b>After War</b>

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:52.900
<b>GUNDAM</b>

00:01:52.900 --> 00:02:00.410
<b>The dream I'd nearly forgotten is beginning to stir,</b>

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:03.370
<b>little by little</b>

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:07.910
<b>filling in the gaps in my heart.</b>

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:15.300
<b>The instant my frozen memories begin to awaken,</b>

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:24.810
<b>my only wish is for the future that is about to begin.</b>

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:28.350
<b>I'll reach out with both hands</b>

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:32.360
<b>and embrace that dream I once had.</b>

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.980
<b>I want to go on believing</b>

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:39.900
<b>without ever letting go or giving up.</b>

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:43.530
<b>Until the day comes when I grab hold...</b>

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:47.410
<b>...of that dream I once had,</b>

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.960
<b>I want to keep chasing after it</b>

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:56.840
<b>without ever forgetting my hopes and dreams.</b>

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:07.310
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:07.310
<b>"My Steed is Vicious"</b>

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:12.650
Tiffa!

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:30.040
Take us in closer!

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.870
But what about that attack?!

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.830
He can't fire again right away! Sara, the bridge is yours!

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.040
Ah, Captain!

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.190
It takes time for it to recharge?!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.190
What?!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:17.540
Huh?

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.480
Surrender. She's a special person.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:44.570
You don't have the right to use them. Not the GX or Tiffa!

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.170
Dr. Techs!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.260
What's her condition?

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.050
Her life isn't in danger.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.470
But if we'd gotten to her any later, she might have been past saving.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:12.930
She needs complete rest for two or three days.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:17.690
You should find somewhere to hide and avoid any firefights for a while.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.650
Let go, damn it!

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.440
Let go, I said! You bastards, that hurts!

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:26.990
Sure thing, kiddo! Just as soon as you stop this tantrum.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.870
Keep complaining, and I'll kick your ass!

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:32.870
Damn it, let go of me!

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.000
You have an adult's energy, if nothing else.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:43.170
Give back Tiffa! Give her back, you bastard!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.670
That won't happen.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.550
Bastards!

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:47.050
Here is why.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.970
When you attacked those people, the pain and fear at the instant of their deaths...

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:56.640
...bombarded her all at once, and she's suffering as a result.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:57.770
What?!

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:03.980
She can read people's minds. Even those of the dying.

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.490
You can't expect that to not take a toll.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:11.240
It's because you showed up! It's because you took Tiffa!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.080
You bastard!

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:24.920
Take him away.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.460
But, he...

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:27.470
That's an order!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:07.300
Yes, it's just one! But it it might be another raid like before!

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.770
Is Von Alternative in there?

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.300
You're Von Alternative, I take it?

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.470
What are you playing at?

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:01.140
My name is Shagia Frost. I'm a freelance mobile suit pilot.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.440
The thing is, I'd like you to hire me.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:18.200
For a privately-owned facility, this is most impressive.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.490
What are you after?

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.080
As I said, I want you to hire me.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.960
It's been a week since the girl Tiffa Adill was abducted, correct?

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:32.090
How did you know about that?!

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:37.600
A week ago, this Alternative Company special research facility...

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.760
...was attacked by a certain Vulture group.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:44.100
Their objective was the abduction of a research subject.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.980
That is to say, Tiffa Adill.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.440
Their plan was successful, and Tiffa was taken from you.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:56.450
You've tried a few schemes to get her back since then.

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.950
And word has it that the old U.N.E.'s ultimate weapon,

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:04.460
the GX-9900, has turned up.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.830
You're certainly well informed.

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:14.130
My work involves spending a great deal of time and effort gathering intel.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:17.970
I also know that this lab's express purpose...

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:23.020
...is to explain the special abilities possessed by that girl, Tiffa.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:28.100
If she is a Newtype, her value to you would be enormous.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.860
If used properly, it's not out of the realm of possibility...

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:35.860
...that the Alternative Co. would rise to the top of the postwar industrial world.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.990
Which is why all information pertaining to Tiffa Adill...

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:42.030
...has been classified Top Secret.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:53.050
I'll get Tiffa Adill back for you.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:57.930
A knight has appeared and will go to the captive queen's rescue, is that it?

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.970
My steed is vicious.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.370
Anything to report?

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:28.620
No, he's been quiet ever since. He hasn't even eaten.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:29.870
I see.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:31.880
Maybe I'll have a word with him.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.540
You need the Captain's permission.

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.960
C'mon, just for a bit! What's the harm?

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:39.880
Seriously, you get like this whenever there's a new guy around.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.600
I'm really picky, I'll have you know.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.220
Anyway, keep a close eye on him.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.140
Will do.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.640
Sweet dreams, if only for five minutes.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:45.200
Hang on, I could've sworn...

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:48.700
It's not like me to nod off like that.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:16.190
Who put these stupid things here?

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:17.980
Wait.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.110
Same old Captain. Always a softie.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.080
So, how is her condition?

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.000
She's improving steadily, but we can't let our guard down.

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:36.830
It'll probably be two or three days before she comes around.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.060
Haven't you found them yet?!

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.860
My apologies, sir. Our radar has been spotty these past few days.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:01.780
Spare me the excuses! Don't report until after you've secured Tiffa!

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.690
Yes, sir! I'm sorry, sir!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.870
It must be nice to be so carefree. But is this any time for games?

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.210
Not at all. I'm hard at work, I assure you.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:23.130
I'm using these cards to divine her location.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.740
Have they found us?

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:50.530
No, it's something else!

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:51.370
Put it on screen!

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.430
He's being chased by those Vultures!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.310
He'll never be able to lose them like that!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.070
They've split into two teams! One is headed our way!

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:32.030
They spotted us?

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:36.040
We mustn't move the Freeden. Send out Witz and Roabea!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.300
Hup!

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:01.310
Sorry fellas, you picked the wrong fight.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:13.530
Come with me.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.830
Come at me from whatever direction you want!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.740
Enemy ship has changed heading! It's coming this way!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:11.380
Watch closely.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.340
They're pros, too.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.640
Let's wrap this up, shall we?

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:54.470
What's the matter? You done already?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:12.110
Th-This is how Gundams fight?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.670
Enemy vessel has gone completely dead.

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:39.510
Why did you show me this?

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.140
Vulture Signs.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.310
Mobile suit pilots and Vultures can signal their intent...

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.980
...using these special flares.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:56.950
Signs have various meanings based on the color of the flares.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:03.540
In this case, it means, "No hostile intent. I surrender completely."

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:19.930
Thank you. That control system malfunction almost cost me my life.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:25.390
For a mobile suit pilot, that Olba guy seems awfully refined.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:28.140
Unlike certain other guys, am I right?

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:32.150
If there is anything that I can do, please let me know.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.860
I'd like to thank you somehow.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.490
Why not work on this ship, then?

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.530
Isn't that right, Captain?

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:42.200
We're on the payroll to provide escort.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:45.450
It's a long story, but the ship has to stay put for a while.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.790
And you would like me to help?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.750
For free, though.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.670
I don't mind. I'll begin as soon as my repairs are finished.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:53.960
Please.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:56.380
Very well.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.510
I'm Toniya Malme! Nice to meet you!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.300
Here we go again.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.470
Is this wise?

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:11.100
I realize that we're shorthanded, but won't this be a problem?

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.310
You're worrying over nothing.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.190
It'll be fine.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:32.580
She's making steady progress. No news is good news, basically.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.080
I see...

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.170
Hey. Those flowers, they're...

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.260
Flowers?

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.640
What about them?

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:48.890
Forget it. It's nothing.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:58.020
Queen takes bishop, knight takes queen.

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:02.860
Knight 4... check!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.830
That was a clever move.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.620
My little brother is a gifted player.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.290
Ah, so he taught you.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:18.170
He's a sweet thing.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:21.010
In addition to being adorable, he's a boy of action.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.510
He should be within arm's reach of Tiffa Adill as we speak.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.220
What?! Is that true?!

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.270
I had a feeling it was you.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.370
Why haven't you run?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.340
As long as Tiffa's aboard that ship, I'm not going anywhere.

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:45.590
There's nothing you can do. You can't take away her pain.

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:49.970
You guys keep chasing her around! Just leave her alone!

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:53.180
Tiffa didn't ask for that kind of power!

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:11.410
My captive princess, I've come for you.

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:13.540
I...

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:16.250
I love Tiffa!

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:22.790
I love you. So badly that I want to kill you.

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:50.820
<b>Can I find the words to tell you</b>

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:50.380
To save Tiffa, whose condition has taken a sudden turn,

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:55.860
Jamil considers a new attack on the Alternative Co.,
which has the facilities to help her.

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:56.200
<b>How I live between the walls of steel and stone</b>

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:00.610
However, the Freeden's crew ask him why he is so intent on helping her.

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:04.040
<b>How I close my eyes to find some kind of rapture</b>

00:23:01.130 --> 00:23:05.780
Garrod is shocked when the profound weight of Jamil's past is revealed.

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:10.380
<b>In a world where you can feel so all alone</b>

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:17.390
<b>Inside I'm full of light and laughter</b>

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:21.270
<b>There's a flame that burns in me</b>

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:22.230
<b>(I need a way)</b>

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:26.320
<b>(I need a way) I need a way to set it free</b>

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:31.240
<b>When you find love in your heart</b>

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.370
<b>(The human touch)</b>

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:37.410
<b>You can believe from the start</b>

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:39.410
<b>(From the start)</b>

00:23:40.330 --> 00:23:42.540
<b>Dreams they come true</b>

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:43.920
<b>(They come true)</b>

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:48.250
<b>All comes to you, oh all at once</b>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:52.050
<b>If you believe in human touch</b>

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:51.550
This operation is a race against the clock!

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:56.180
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:56.180
<b>"This operation is a race against the clock!"</b>

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:58.180
<b></b>
